{"about_the_game":"A short, cute, colorful 2D platformer inspired by the energy and exploration of Kirby's Adventure. The round structure borrows ideas from Star Fox 64 - you pick your path through a series of levels in pursuit of a high score. The levels themselves meanwhile blend the sprawling nature of Sonic 1's levels with the room-structure of Kirby's Adventure's levels.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836060/extras/FlameLandmock52024-04-2712-47-44-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751210803\" /></div><br><strong>Run</strong> through <strong>SHORT, SNAPPY</strong> levels.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836060/extras/FlameLandmock52024-04-2712-00-02-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751210803\" /></div><br><strong>Build</strong> a team of four characters to take on the evil king.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836060/extras/FlameLandmock52024-04-2711-59-18-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751210803\" /></div><br><strong>Pick</strong> your path through the game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836060/extras/FlameLandmock52024-04-2711-58-37-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1751210803\" /></div><br><strong>Explore</strong> each level with its many paths, looking for <strong>SECRETS</strong> around every turn.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2836060?t=1751210803","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751210803","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2836060/f45e0291f3d16d189b6ed4a9f47f3d767c4062c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751210803","capsule_imagev5"